+# SRDZsh app cryptex acceptance criteria
+
+- arm64e iOS 26+ binaries, real root PTY broker launched in the system domain.
+- A Home Screen app icon, local terminal emulator, keyboard, control keys,
+  resizing, ZLE, job control, completion, persistent root history.
+- One shell per connection; no inactivity timer or command execution deadline.
+  State remains while the app retains its connection, including suspension.
+  Explicit exit, New session, app termination, or reboot ends a session.
+- Root privilege means real/effective UID and GID 0, confirmed by `id` and a
+  write/read/remove test in `/var/root`, not environment variable labels.
+- Complete upstream function tree and all standard Darwin-supported modules,
+  including zftp. Optional Linux capabilities, GDBM, and PCRE modules require
+  their platform/library dependencies and are not falsely advertised.
+- Existing `/var/jb` tools and every mounted cryptex are discoverable. A native
+  signed Toybox supplies standalone basic Unix commands on a newly enrolled SRD.
+- Stable cryptex ID `com.liquidsky.srdzsh`, app ID
+  `codes.liquidsky.research.srdzsh`, writable state in `/var/root`.
+- Raw SDK-prepared APFS DMG, manifest-bound trust-cache assets, and optional IPA.
+  Installation uses exact-device Native RemoteXPC and fresh Apple TSS research
+  authorization. Developer Mode alone on a production iPhone is insufficient.
+- Both attached iPhones must show the app icon and pass on-device root, module,
+  terminal resize, signal, command and session lifetime checks. Reboot persistence
+  is configured but only claimed tested if an authorized reboot is performed.
+
+## Neofetch update
+
+- Bundle upstream Neofetch 7.1.0 with MIT license, manual, a signed GNU Bash
+  scripting runtime and its GPL license/source provenance.
+- Preserve upstream flags and writable user configuration; adapt iOS version,
+  model, uptime and memory queries to native APIs so no jailbreak tools are
+  required. Report real iOS version and host model on each phone.
+- Keep all existing root terminal behavior and modules; install version 2.0.5
+  through Native RemoteXPC on both currently authorized devices.
+- Verify `neofetch --stdout`, ASCII output and option handling in the actual root
+  PTY on both phones, using only bundled tools in the test PATH.
